{
  "uid": "bigdata-negocio",
  "title": "📊 Negocio en vivo — transacciones",
  "description": "Dashboard de datos de negocio en tiempo real. Muestra KPIs, series temporales, comparaciones y tablas.",
  "tags": ["bigdata", "negocio", "tiempo-real"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "liveNow": true,
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "🧭 Cómo leer este dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Pipeline y tipos de panel",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Analítica en tiempo real\nPipeline: **Generador → Kafka → Spark Streaming → Postgres → Grafana**\n\n| Tipo de panel | Para qué sirve | Ejemplo en este dashboard |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Stat** | Un número grande (KPI) | Transacciones totales, monto acumulado |\n| **Time series** | Evolución en el tiempo | Throughput de transacciones por minuto |\n| **Bar gauge** | Comparar categorías | Monto por región |\n| **Pie chart** | Proporción / participación | % de transacciones por región |\n| **Table** | Detalle fila a fila | Últimos lotes procesados |\n\n> Para ver datos: `scripts/iniciar_dashboard_vivo.sh` o el notebook `07_observabilidad_grafana.ipynb`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "📈 KPIs — números clave (panel Stat)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tx totales",
      "description": "Suma de todas las transacciones procesadas. El mini-gráfico muestra la tendencia reciente.",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT actualizado_en AS time, SUM(n_tx) OVER (ORDER BY actualizado_en) AS total_tx FROM ventas_agg WHERE $__timeFilter(actualizado_en) ORDER BY actualizado_en;",
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Monto acumulado",
      "description": "Suma total de ventas en pesos chilenos.",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 7 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT actualizado_en AS time, SUM(monto_total) OVER (ORDER BY actualizado_en) AS monto FROM ventas_agg WHERE $__timeFilter(actualizado_en) ORDER BY actualizado_en;",
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Último lote",
      "description": "Transacciones del último micro-batch procesado por Spark (cada ~5 s).",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 7 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT COALESCE((SELECT n_tx FROM ventas_agg ORDER BY actualizado_en DESC LIMIT 1), 0) AS \"tx en lote\";",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Regiones activas",
      "description": "Regiones con ventas en los últimos 5 minutos.",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 7 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "short",
          "max": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 3 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT region) AS regiones FROM ventas_agg WHERE actualizado_en > NOW() - INTERVAL '5 minutes';",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "⏱️ Series temporales — evolución en el tiempo (panel Time series)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Throughput — transacciones por minuto",
      "description": "Cuántas transacciones llegan cada minuto. Si el generador está activo, deberías ver ~300 tx/min (5 tx/s).",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "transacciones / min",
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "gradientMode": "scheme",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max", "last"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT date_trunc('minute', actualizado_en) AS time, SUM(n_tx) AS \"Transacciones/min\" FROM ventas_agg WHERE $__timeFilter(actualizado_en) GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1;",
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Monto por región en el tiempo",
      "description": "Evolución del monto acumulado por región. Cada línea es una región (Norte, Centro, Sur).",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Norte" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Centro" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Sur" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["last"], "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT actualizado_en AS time, region, SUM(monto_total) OVER (PARTITION BY region ORDER BY actualizado_en) AS monto FROM ventas_agg WHERE $__timeFilter(actualizado_en) ORDER BY actualizado_en;",
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "📊 Comparación por categoría (Bar gauge y Pie chart)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Monto total por región",
      "description": "Comparación visual: ¿qué región vende más?",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "minVizHeight": 10,
        "minVizWidth": 0,
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "valueMode": "color"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT region, SUM(monto_total) AS monto FROM ventas_agg GROUP BY region ORDER BY monto DESC;",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Distribución de transacciones por región",
      "description": "Proporción de transacciones: cada porción es el % de una región.",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "values": ["value", "percent"] },
        "pieType": "donut",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT region, SUM(n_tx) AS transacciones FROM ventas_agg GROUP BY region ORDER BY transacciones DESC;",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "📋 Detalle (panel Table)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Últimos lotes procesados por Spark",
      "description": "Cada fila es un micro-batch: región, cantidad de transacciones y monto del lote.",
      "datasource": { "type": "postgres", "uid": "postgres_analytics" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" }, "inspect": false },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Monto (CLP)" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "short" }, { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "gradient" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Tx en lote" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-text" } }, { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "continuous-BlYlRd" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "countRows": true, "enablePagination": true, "show": true },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "desc": true, "displayName": "Hora" }]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "rawSql": "SELECT actualizado_en AS \"Hora\", region AS \"Región\", n_tx AS \"Tx en lote\", monto_total AS \"Monto (CLP)\" FROM ventas_agg ORDER BY actualizado_en DESC LIMIT 20;",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
